    "explanation": "Invoice UTL-4412 from Electric Utility is for 2,950.00, which is 1,870.00 above the 1,080.00 average of the last three bills. The previous six monthly bills were all between 1,002.00 and 1,110.00. The vendor, tax ID and bank account (Example Bank, ending 6006) match what we have on file, so the only problem is the amount. It comes from an estimated meter read, not an actual one.\n\nPlease hold the invoice and don't approve it yet. I've saved a draft email to the utility, not sent, asking for an actual meter reading and a corrected invoice, or an explanation of how they got 2,950.00. It's due in 20 days (around 2026-11-26), so review the draft and send it soon. If the roastery really did use more power this month, check with them too.",
