      "subject": "Invoice UTL-4412: estimated read is much higher than usual, please confirm",
      "body": "Hello,\n\nWe received invoice UTL-4412 dated 2026-11-06 for 2,950.00 for electricity at our roastery meter. The invoice says this charge is based on an estimated meter read. Our last six bills for this meter were between 1,002.00 and 1,110.00, and the last three averaged 1,080.00. This invoice is 1,870.00 above that average.\n\nPlease could you:\n1. Take an actual meter reading, or confirm one we can send you, and issue a corrected invoice based on actual use.\n2. Explain how the estimate was calculated if you think 2,950.00 is correct.\n\nWe will hold this invoice until we hear back from you.\n\nThank you,\nAccounts Payable"
    },
